  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Diện tích đáy bé <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">đáy bé</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>△</mi><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">đều</mtext></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><msup><mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>24</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>25</mn></mfrac><msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Diện tích đáy lớn <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">đáy lớn</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Mỗi mặt bên là một hình thang cân có đáy lớn là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>1</mn></semantics></math>m, đáy nhỏ là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></semantics></math> m. Đường cao hình thang <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>10</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> m. <br>Diện tích một mặt bên là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>27</mn><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>100</mn></mfrac><msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy diện tích cần sơn là\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>24</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>25</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>27</mn><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>55</mn><msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div></div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/9bdcd723bddc8d9e6a2a7a0c17afb9d6447a800c18c73c9836c5354c0eecac96.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
